We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.910
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.720
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.350
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.460
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.960
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.460
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.870
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.630
Fly up, angel

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.670
What's goin' on?

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.660
What're you doing?!

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.580
A RAPT mobile unit is conducting
a mop-up of Shibuya as we speak!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.380
Let's see...

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:15.490
--120 grams of cake flour for 442 calories.
--The area was designated off-limits
after the earthquake 3 years ago,

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:16.750
--Two eggs is 170 calories,

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:21.750
--so the metabolic rate plus 1.02 times...
--but illegal trespassers and construction
escalated as it became a lawless region.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.660
What could that be?

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.570
What happened to Tokyo?!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:47.020
This town has no need
for wolves or stray dogs.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.590
All our farms need are
obedient little sheep.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:55.360
Brainless sheep that don't know a thing...

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.060
I'm relieved to see you doing well!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.000
Thank you for coming, Sei...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.340
Seeing your face is
the best medicine for me.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:15.500
--How about you? Are you well?
--Yes... Of course...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.810
Sei...

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:23.310
You've had a strong sense of
responsibility since you were a child...

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.760
You try to carry burdens all by yourself...

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.450
Grandfather...

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.860
Sei... You needn't any longer...

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.060
Eh?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:42.470
I am the one who placed
far too much on your shoulders...

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:45.540
Nothing in this world lasts forever.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.610
All things perpetually change.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:52.480
Not even Bailan is absolute...

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.820
I had a dream this morning.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:59.320
In it, a golden dragon ascended
from a sea of crashing waves,

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:03.120
through a storm, and up into the heavens.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.100
Sei...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.900
Put aside the fact that you are
the granddaughter of Bailan's elder...

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:14.700
...and follow the path that you,
as an individual, believe to be best.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:19.000
There you will find what you must do...

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:24.450
Hello? Amy? It's been a while.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:29.050
Sei! Long time, no call!
How'd you know I was here?

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:32.790
Never mind that. I have something
urgent I need your help with.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.280
Think you're up to it?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.030
Would this be a Bailan job?

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:41.330
No. It's a personal request.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.490
I want you to find Jo and Meg.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:46.370
Then count me in!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.240
I'm going to see Jinno-san now.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:16.830
How I'd love some hot
coffee right about now...

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.230
Jo! Are you alright?!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.570
Where are we?

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.510
On some beach...

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.680
What happened to Maria?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:32.770
She died so we could get off the ship...

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.780
--She's dead?
--Yeah...

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.190
I see.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.860
But I'm glad you're alive!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:46.260
I do feel bad for her, but you're
the most important to me!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:53.040
When my clothes dry, I'll go into
town to buy food and stuff to wear.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.870
Rest here until then, OK?

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:59.840
Yeah. My head's still hazy...

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.810
Let me sleep a little...

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.720
Say, Jo...

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.420
What?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.390
Let's go on a trip when you get better...

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.090
We can get away from
this messed up place...

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:21.560
A place with no bad guys, where just
the two of us can live happily...

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.730
Let's do that, OK?

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.280
<i>Have a nice rest, Jo</i>...

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.740
<i>From now on, I'll protect you</i>...

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.190
This doesn't make sense...

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:55.900
I can't comprehend
why I don't want to fight...

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:59.600
What do I do...?!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.370
Live on... and find the answer...!

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.380
Maria...

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:13.080
Are you dead...?

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.140
Jo! Hit the deck!

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:57.190
That felt great! So refreshing!

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:59.300
Huh?

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:02.560
Gross! What <i>are</i> these guys?!

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.830
Puppets controlled by brain monsters.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:08.300
Anyway, how did you find me?!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:12.940
You should at least thank me
for saving you from danger first!

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.410
Not just yet!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.010
There's one left!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.910
Above!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.650
A friend of those monsters?!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.680
Apparently, but this one's meaner!

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.530
--Who's inside?!
--Leo-<i>chan</i> is!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.740
What is that?!

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:51.250
A micro-beacon they implanted.
They used it to follow you.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:55.850
Though it did help us find you, too.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.750
Did Sei ask you to come?

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:02.020
Yeah. She told me where to find
the trailer and Django.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.490
And she had Amy search for you.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:06.800
I see.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.500
Did Sei say anything else?

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.770
She did mention she was going
to RAPT Headquarters...

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:17.240
Tokyo's practically theirs now!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:22.780
They're arrestin' anyone
who breaks even the tiniest rules!

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:26.520
Sei's group joined with RAPT.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.540
So why send Django to me...?

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:34.450
Actually, she gave me
one other thing to give you.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.390
This.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:43.630
Sei sent this...?

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:48.260
I've been requested to
assist in RAPT operations.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:53.140
Because Bailan's new leader
has joined the group

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:55.340
that secretly controls RAPT...

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:58.580
Are you a member of RAPT now, Sei?

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.680
No! It's not like that!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:05.190
--My current situation requires..
--Alright.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.020
Explain the plan.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.750
<i>Don't die on me, Sei!</i>

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.400
I'm going to RAPT Headquarters!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.930
I'd expect no less!
Naturally, we'll be taggin' along!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:29.580
Guess sockin' my dad a good one
and rushin' over here was worth it!

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.310
Stop it!

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.450
We're talking about RAPT here!
You can't possibly win!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.200
You don't have to do this!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.100
Like I said before...

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:54.330
...let's live happily far away
from here, just the two of us!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.910
You've always fought
with your life on the line...

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.250
...and gotten yourself torn up...!

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:07.080
You don't have to get hurt anymore...!

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:09.140
Come with me, Jo!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.760
Jo...?

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:16.820
Sei's planning to fight alone.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.920
To free Tokyo from RAPT's control...

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.720
To wipe out the real bad guys
behind the scenes...

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.770
...I must go!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.140
I can't let Sei die!

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:36.210
T-Then I'll come, too!
I'll go wherever you go!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.250
I'll never leave you, no matter what!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.350
Listen to me, Meg.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:44.220
I'm not an ordinary person.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:49.890
I was created as a living weapon for war.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:53.060
I didn't exactly ask for it...

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:57.800
But if I can use this strength
to accomplish something...

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:02.530
...I think that might be my fate...

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.070
I can't run away from it...!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:11.650
What's happened to you?!
It's like you're not the Jo I know...!

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.650
Jo was always kind to me...!

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:18.790
Whenever I'd get caught,
she'd always rescue me

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.380
and let me be by her side!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.790
This is goodbye, Meg.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:32.870
From now on, fight for
those that need you...

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:36.500
That is the future you must search for.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.870
No!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:45.140
I don't want that future!
Without you, I'm.. I'm...!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:52.620
Alright, fine. Stop crying, Meg...

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.690
Really?

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.720
So I can come with you?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.790
No.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.400
We'll get ready to go! Hurry, now!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.110
Forgive me, Meg...

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.330
Do you copy, Amy? This is Jo.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.770
We're on our way to demolish
RAPT Headquarters.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.700
Bring me up to speed.

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:43.810
Roger! I'm doing a mission, too!

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:48.080
RAPT has blocked <i>all</i> roads
leading into Tokyo right now.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.080
And there are cybots acting
as barricades on the Mega Highway...

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:56.790
And there's lots of new
models all around RAPT HQ...

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.020
Once you bust through the barricades,

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.250
I'll screw up their communication lines!

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:04.620
We're counting on you!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.630
I'm Sei from Bailan.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:14.120
Please inform Mr. Glenford
that I've come on urgent business.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.240
Jo...! Don't go...!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.340
Just a dream...

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.130
You're so..

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:41.060
You're so stupid, Jo!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:50.070
Target confirmed! Currently downtown,
racing toward Shinjuku!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.570
I'd get the hell outta
the way if I were you!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:03.810
Here's one for ya, straight from Osaka!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.300
Everyone ready?

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.500
All set, Amy-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.830
OK! Let's do it!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:22.870
"Stupid-head"

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:27.010
--What the...?!
--What's going on?

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:30.240
Emergency! Deploy all units
and secure the perimeter!

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.380
Here they come!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.920
Jo! You're up!

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.330
Get the hell off...!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:38.940
Not good!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.490
Jo!

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:05.940
Is this your urgent business?

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:09.110
And you came all the way
here just to tell me?

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.080
That's right.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.710
I arranged it so I <i>could</i>
come all the way here.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.390
Is that wise?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:21.420
This will mean the end
of both you and Bailan...

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.320
As well as you...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.680
Here we go!

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:02.460
"Morons! - Lamebrains!"

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.120
We have comms back!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.860
Do you actually think you've won?

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:32.790
Killing me will do nothing.
I'm only one part of the program.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.970
If it's destroyed, the program
will be repaired and return to normal.

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:40.570
Ultimately, this will all happen again...

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:45.740
We will feed this nation's
sheep, and harvest them.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:49.470
They will simply live their lives
oblivious to that fact.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.820
The lot of you will be crushed
and die pointlessly.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.510
You can't possibly change anything.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.000
Sei!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:19.770
Jo...

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:22.470
Get that...!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.850
I'll take you...!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.780
Take you to Hell!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.610
Jo... Stay alive...!

